OL,3,GNEWSACommunity helps shape art tribute
OL,4,Ato Uriah Rennie
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public artwork in tribute to
OL,7,Fhistory-making referee Uriah Rennie is
OL,8,Fbeing developed with the help of the
OL,9,Fcommunity.
OL,11,FRennie, who was the Premier League's
OL,12,Ffirst black referee, died in June 2025
OL,13,Fafter being diagnosed with cancer.
OL,15,FIn honour of the trailblazing official,
OL,16,Fmembers of the public were invited to
OL,17,Fcollaborate with artist Nicole White to
OL,18,Fhelp shape the bespoke artwork.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
